Filters help

h) This help document.
For help with a particular filter, open it and press h.

q) Finish the adjustment and stay in Filters. Press q from Filters to return to Top Level. Changes are kept.

Support depends on your radio and mode. Press a filter key to read its current setting without changing it.

a) Auto Notch
b) Noise Blanker
c) Contour
l) Low Cut
n) Manual Notch
p) Passband width
r) Noise Reduction
u) Upper Cut
v) Verify active filters

